## Tune process/port limits and enable kernel poll for factory-scale BEAM.
+P 1000000
+Q 1000000
+K true

## Crash dump location — override via ERL_CRASH_DUMP env at runtime.
## -env ERL_CRASH_DUMP /tmp/erl_crash.dump

## Cookie and node name are provided at runtime by the release scripts from
## RELEASE_COOKIE / RELEASE_NODE env. Do NOT add -setcookie/-name here:
## vm.args gets no runtime env expansion, so `${RELEASE_COOKIE}` reached the
## VM as a LITERAL trailing flag — the node silently fell back to the
## ~/.erlang.cookie file and every `bin/gitf rpc` died with :noconnection
## (the live-console outage diagnosed 2026-08-16).
